      "writtenOn": "2018-05-24T12:03:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Aah okay. So, the PM3 LDN is the one that needs to be enabled for port80 communication. But the setting in RTCT needs to be set for port80 index. I will add a comment for the same. Thanks!\n\nAnother question: Section 7.21.4 says that P80LC is read-only and it looks like we are setting DSLDC6 i.e. P80LC to 0. However, section 6.3.10.19 says that P80LC is R/W. Which of the two is correct?",
      "parentUuid": "6f8b1053_18b5e2c8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 105,
